  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Wapa PPE and Garment Production Training Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wapa Textile &amp; Garment Manufacturing Ltd, through a competitive application process, was chosen to receive grant financing from USADF and LSETF. Wapa Textile &amp; Garment Manufacturing Ltd is proposing training for 190 unemployed Lagos State residents to train on fabric and garment making with specific emphasis on PPE production. They will train 190 students over a 3 month curriculum.</narrative>
  </description>
